cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "SFR: Silent Failure Rate"
message: "If you use this specification, or claim conformance to it, please cite it as below."
type: software
abstract: >-
  A specification for measuring how often an automation platform accepts a unit
  of work, reports no problem, and does not complete it. Defines the metric, the
  exclusion of failures refused at send, reference workloads, a data contract for
  per-event reconciliation, statistical reporting requirements, and three
  self-declared conformance levels.
authors:
  - given-names: Hao
    family-names: Xu
    affiliation: BenchTruth
    city: Sydney
    country: AU
repository-code: "https://github.com/benchtruth/sfr-spec"
url: "https://benchtruth.com/spec"
license: CC-BY-4.0
version: "1.0"
keywords:
  - silent failure rate
  - automation
  - workflow automation
  - reliability
  - benchmarking
  - webhooks
  - measurement specification
